@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### List products page 0
GET {{gateway}}/api/products?page=0&size=12

### Search by query
GET {{gateway}}/api/products?q=iphone

### Filter by category slug
GET {{gateway}}/api/products?category=elektronik&size=20

### Detail by slug
GET {{gateway}}/api/products/slug/iphone-15-pro-256gb

### Categories
GET {{gateway}}/api/categories
